' Console application - created with the Ilwaco IDE.
' Plain FreeBASIC: Print writes text and Color sets the text colour.
' Both work natively on Linux - edit Main.bas to start building.

Color 10   ' bright green
Print "Hello, world!"

Color 7    ' back to the default light grey
Print
Print "This is a FreeBASIC console application created with Ilwaco."
Print "Edit Main.bas to start building your program."
Print
